<title>PORTUGAL: Oporto bourse studies new futures contracts.</title>
<headline>Oporto bourse studies new futures contracts.</headline>
<dateline>OPORTO, Portugal 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Oporto Derivatives Exchange (BDP) is considering launching new share futures, but any decision will depend on the performance of the recently launched contract on Portugal Telecom (PT), BDP managing director Manuel Alves Monteiro said.</p>
<p>&quot;New share future contracts are being studied, but everything depends on the performance of the PT future, which has been a success so far,&quot; Alves Monteiro told Reuters.</p>
<p>-- Rui Neves, Lisbon newsroom 351-1-8254</p>
</text>
